I have to add the following lines to /sys/conf/<HOSTNAME>

bus             i2o0       at *
controller      i2o_bs0    at i2o0      slot  0
device disk     ri0        at i2o_bs0   drive     0
controller      i2o_bs1    at i2o0      slot  0
device disk     ri1        at i2o_bs1   drive     1

config_driver pza

and rebuild a new kernel with
# doconfig -c <HOSTNAME>

Copy it to / and reboot.


